{"id":"aae185fc93a18a8a","group":"20","path":"20/20-ex-omega-rank-closed-class.md","title":"可计算树中的秩 ω 点","display":"ex-omega-rank-closed-class — 可计算树中的秩 ω 点","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-ex-omega-rank-closed-class","aliases":["20-ex-omega-rank-closed-class"],"display":"ex-omega-rank-closed-class — 可计算树中的秩 ω 点","chapter":"8","section":"8.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 8.7.9(iii)","source_printed_pages":[173],"source_pdf_pages":[206],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tree]]","[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]","[[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-ex-omega-rank-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-ex-omega-rank-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-omega-rank-closed-class — 可计算树中的秩 ω 点"},{"key":"chapter","html":"8"},{"key":"section","html":"8.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 8.7.9(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>173</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>206</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60a10f7c9ce5cbb7\" href=\"?note=60a10f7c9ce5cbb7\" title=\"20-ex-bounded-zero-rank\">20-ex-bounded-zero-rank</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n\">\\(C_n\\)</span> 为至多含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个零的闭类。令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C=\\{1^\\omega\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{1^n0^\\frown X:X\\in C_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C=\\{1^\\omega\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{1^n0^\\frown X:X\\in C_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>树 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 由全 1 串及首个零位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>、其后至多含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个零的有限串组成。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"93a810534b87b0f9\" href=\"?note=93a810534b87b0f9\" title=\"20-df-tree\">20-df-tree</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60a10f7c9ce5cbb7\" href=\"?note=60a10f7c9ce5cbb7\" title=\"20-ex-bounded-zero-rank\">20-ex-bounded-zero-rank</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}omega-rank-closed-class}\\vdash\nC=[T],\\quad T\\text{ 可计算},\\quad C^{[\\omega]}=\\{1^\\omega\\},\\quad\nC^{[\\omega+1]}=\\varnothing,\\quad\\rho_C(1^\\omega)=\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}omega-rank-closed-class}\\vdash\nC=[T],\\quad T\\text{ 可计算},\\quad C^{[\\omega]}=\\{1^\\omega\\},\\quad\nC^{[\\omega+1]}=\\varnothing,\\quad\\rho_C(1^\\omega)=\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>树成员关系有限可判定且向下闭合，路径描述正好为给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。柱 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[1^n0]\">\\([1^n0]\\)</span> 开闭，其导集迭代只依赖内部的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n\">\\(C_n\\)</span>，所以经过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 次导集后该块在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;k\">\\(n&lt;k\\)</span> 时为空，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge k\">\\(n\\ge k\\)</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n0^\\frown C_{n-k}\">\\(1^n0^\\frown C_{n-k}\\)</span>。每个有限层仍有任意大的非空块逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^\\omega\">\\(1^\\omega\\)</span>，故该点在所有有限层中非孤立。任意其他点位于一个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 块，至多在第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 层删除；极限层只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^\\omega\">\\(1^\\omega\\)</span>，下一层为空。这是原书所要求的具体可计算见证。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 173 / PDF 206。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-ex-bounded-zero-rank","status":"resolved","id":"60a10f7c9ce5cbb7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"93a810534b87b0f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-ex-bounded-zero-rank","status":"resolved","id":"60a10f7c9ce5cbb7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]；see [[20-ex-bounded-zero-rank]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"C=\\{1^\\omega\\}\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\{1^n0^\\frown X:X\\in C_n\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}omega-rank-closed-class}\\vdash\nC=[T],\\quad T\\text{ 可计算},\\quad C^{[\\omega]}=\\{1^\\omega\\},\\quad\nC^{[\\omega+1]}=\\varnothing,\\quad\\rho_C(1^\\omega)=\\omega.","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"[1^n0]","display":false},{"tex":"C_n","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"n<k","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge k","display":false},{"tex":"1^n0^\\frown C_{n-k}","display":false},{"tex":"1^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"1^\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1706,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["93a810534b87b0f9","14fc2af0ac27dcbb","60a10f7c9ce5cbb7"]}